# Faerie Fencing's Faerie is the one you controlled as you finished casting it (CR 601.2i: the spell becomes cast once its costs
# are paid, 601.2g-h). The Dragon cycle's ruling says the same: "if you lose control of your only Dragon while casting the spell
# (because, for example, you sacrificed it to activate a mana ability), you won't get the bonus." Bot1 controls Faerie Mastermind
# as it begins to cast Fencing with X = 1 at Bot2's Concealing Curtains (0/4), and pays {B} by sacrificing the Mastermind to
# Phyrexian Altar while paying. It controlled no Faerie as the spell became cast: the Curtains get -1/-1 alone, -1/3 (with the
# bonus they would die).

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
Black Lotus
Mox Ruby
Phyrexian Altar
Faerie Mastermind
Faerie Fencing
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp
Concealing Curtains
Swamp x18

